## PROJECT IDENTITY

**Product Name:** EduNexus — Next-Generation School Management Ecosystem
**Client:** Premium private school group in Dubai, UAE
**Ambition:** Build the most intelligent, beautiful, and comprehensive school management platform in the Middle East — a product that makes iSAMS, PowerSchool, and ManageBac feel outdated the moment a user sees our first screen.
