## PART 1 — DESIGN SYSTEM AND VISUAL IDENTITY

### 1.1 Design Philosophy

This is NOT a generic school admin panel. This is a premium enterprise SaaS product that communicates trust, intelligence, and innovation from the first pixel. Study the design quality of Linear, Vercel, Stripe Dashboard, Notion, and Mercury — then apply that level of craft to education.

Every screen must feel intentional. No default Tailwind components without customization. No generic card layouts. No amateur spacing. No inconsistent typography. The product must feel like it was designed by a world-class design team at a top-tier SaaS company.

